<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Case Study: FGS Global - NetSuite Transformation</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2c3e50;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: slideUp 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50 0%, #34495e 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 30px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .section:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .section h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #3498db;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -3px;
            left: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #e74c3c;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .section p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .challenges ul, .actions ol {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .challenges li {
            background: #fff5f5;
            border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .challenges li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .actions li {
            background: #f0f9ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            counter-increment: action-counter;
        }

        .actions {
            counter-reset: action-counter;
        }

        .actions li::before {
            content: counter(action-counter);
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            width: 25px;
            height: 25px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-right: 10px;
            float: left;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .actions li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .results {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
        }

        .results ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .results li {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .results li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.2);
        }

        .testimonial {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd 0%, #ffeaa7 100%);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .testimonial::before {
            content: '"';
            font-size: 6rem;
            color: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.3);
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            left: 20px;
            font-family: serif;
        }

        .testimonial p {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .testimonial .author {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #856404;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .metrics {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .metric-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .metric-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
            display: block;
        }

        .metric-label {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .back-link {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                margin: 10px;
                border-radius: 15px;
            }
            
            .header {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .content {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            
            .section {
                padding: 20px;
                margin-bottom: 25px;
            }
            
            .back-link {
                position: static;
                display: inline-block;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a href="#" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Case Study: FGS Global</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">NetSuite OneWorld Transformation & Process Optimization</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Client Profile</h2>
                <p>Global strategic communications firm with 10+ subsidiaries, recently acquired by KKR. The organization required public-company rigor with a multi-subsidiary NetSuite OneWorld implementation already in place but underperforming.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>My Role</h2>
                <p>Interim NetSuite Director & Solution Architect—bridging Finance, Operations, and external vendors to rescue and scale the ERP environment while serving as a standing member of the project <strong>Steering Committee</strong>.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section challenges">
                <h2>Key Challenges</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Poor initial solution design; Order-to-Cash (OTC) and billing workflows fragmented across teams</li>
                    <li>Month-end close stuck at 9 days, reliant on manual journal entries and spreadsheets</li>
                    <li>No unified change-management process; limited documentation, low user confidence</li>
                    <li>Global subsidiaries onboarding without a repeatable model</li>
                    <li>Multiple satellite systems (HRIS, travel-management, FP&A) required real-time integration to NetSuite</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Actions Taken</h2>
                <ol class="actions">
                    <li><strong>Redesigned ARM & OTC:</strong> Built a unified ARM configuration that cleaned up revenue schedules and became the template for all future subsidiaries. Delivered step-by-step documentation and trained cross-functional teams.</li>
                    <li><strong>Created Finance SOP & Close Playbook:</strong> Authored end-to-end close procedures, approval matrices, and change-management workflows in Confluence for visibility and auditability.</li>
                    <li><strong>Architectural Governance & Integration Oversight:</strong> Actively contributed to the weekly Architecture Review Board and provided day-to-day guidance on inbound HRIS and travel-portal integrations—ensuring data consistency and performance.</li>
                    <li><strong>Steering-Committee Involvement:</strong> Presented solution-design options, ticket-prioritization updates, and quality/timeframe assessments at monthly meetings; facilitated timely risk escalation and executive decision-making.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section results">
                <h2>Results</h2>
                <div class="metrics">
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">9→5</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Days Close Cycle Reduction</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">10→3</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Days Billing Turnaround</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">3</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Countries Rolled Out</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Close cycle cut from 9 → 5 days</strong> with no "shortcut" journal entries</li>
                    <li><strong>Billing turnaround reduced from 10 → 3 days,</strong> accelerating cash-flow</li>
                    <li>Unified OTC model rolled out to Germany, Japan, China on a two-month cadence</li>
                    <li>End-users gained self-service reporting; leadership regained confidence in NetSuite data</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section testimonial">
                <h2>Client Testimonial</h2>
                <p>"Gabriel's technical expertise and client-support mindset quickly brought critical areas under control and restored confidence across the team."</p>
                <p class="author">– Ryan Eppehimer, CFO, FGS Global</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
